\begin_layout Chapter
Definition of Expressions
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Calculation thread:
\series default
 The execution of a model in time steps (e.g., the run method of a compiled Java model), started with the Start/Pause action of the toolbar.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Chunk:
\series default
 A block of code in an R Markdown or Quarto document (e.g., an R or a Python chunk) which is executed when the document is rendered (or inline in the Markdown editor of Bio7).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Custom view:
\series default
 A view of Bio7 which is created programmatically (e.g., for a GUI of a model, an R plot or a Python plot).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Discretize:
\series default
 In Bio7 the process of transferring continuous data to discrete data.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Embedded R, embedded Python:
\series default
 R and Python run in the process of Bio7 (Foreign Function & Memory API of Java): the data are transferred directly, without a server or a separate process.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
IDE
\series default
 (Integrated Development Environment): A type of software that assists in developing software.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Namespace
\series default
 (BeanShell): A namespace in which methods, variables, and imports (class names) live.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Perspective:
\series default
 An arrangement of views and editors for a task (e.g., the R perspective, the 3d perspective).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Programmatically:
\series default
 Using programming to accomplish a task.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Snippets:
\series default
 In Bio7 a small piece of programming source code to demonstrate some of the Bio7 features.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Theme:
\series default
 The colors, fonts, icon colors and artwork of the Bio7 user interface (light, dark or a custom theme).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
View:
\series default
 A window of the Bio7 workbench (e.g., the R-Shell view or the Space view) which can be arranged in a perspective.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
WindowBuilder:
\series default
 A visual designer for SWT user interfaces; in Bio7 a WindowBuilder GUI can be exported as a Shiny app or a JavaScript app.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Workspace
\series default
 (Bio7): The location where the projects and files are stored.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
